WEBVTT

NOTE
Narration over progressive instrumental music.

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:11.500
One enquiry. One connected workspace. See how Travel O S brings a Sri Lanka journey to life.

2
00:00:11.500 --> 00:00:24.500
Start with the traveller's brief. Two adults, five days, four nights, with a route through the hills, the coast and Colombo.

3
00:00:24.500 --> 00:00:34.000
Extract the trip details, then review the dates, rooming and customer information before opening the costing.

4
00:00:34.000 --> 00:00:42.500
Choose a complete programme from the tour library, and refine every day around the enquiry.

5
00:00:42.500 --> 00:00:53.000
Check hotel contracts against the actual travel dates. Add transport, meals and sightseeing in the same workspace.

6
00:00:53.000 --> 00:01:01.000
Review the price and the remaining checks before preparing the customer quotation.

7
00:01:01.000 --> 00:01:13.000
From quotation preparation to reservation operations and accounts, your team can follow the work across Travel O S.

8
00:01:13.000 --> 00:01:20.500
Built for real travel work. Explore Travel O S with Navigeto.